flowchart TD
    START([pait orchestrate]) --> BANNER[Display banner]
    BANNER --> CONFIG[Load config & state]
    CONFIG --> RESET{--reset?}
    RESET -->|yes| CLEAR[Clear state] --> FLAGS_CHECK{Other flags?}
    FLAGS_CHECK -->|no| DONE([Exit])
    FLAGS_CHECK -->|yes| STATUS_CHECK
    RESET -->|no| STATUS_CHECK{--status?}
    STATUS_CHECK -->|yes| SHOW_STATUS[Print status] --> DONE

    STATUS_CHECK -->|no| VERIFY_CFG{Verify commands\nconfigured?}
    VERIFY_CFG -->|no| PROMPT_VERIFY[Prompt for verify commands]
    PROMPT_VERIFY --> NO_VERIFY{Commands provided?}
    NO_VERIFY -->|no| FAIL_EXIT([Exit 1])
    NO_VERIFY -->|yes| SAVE_VERIFY[Save to .pait/orchestrator.json]
    SAVE_VERIFY --> FETCH
    VERIFY_CFG -->|yes| FETCH

    FETCH{--file?} -->|yes| READ_MD[Parse markdown file] --> BUILD_GRAPH
    FETCH -->|no| GH_FETCH[Fetch GitHub issues\nauthor-filtered] --> BUILD_GRAPH

    BUILD_GRAPH[Build dependency graph\nTopological sort] --> PLAN_DISPLAY
    PLAN_DISPLAY[Display execution plan] --> RECONCILE

    RECONCILE[Reconcile state with GitHub\nCheck PRs / branches / splits] --> DRY_RUN{--dry-run?}
    DRY_RUN -->|yes| DRY[Show plan without acting] --> DONE

    DRY_RUN -->|no| MODE{--parallel N > 1?}
    MODE -->|yes| PARALLEL[Run parallel loop\nN concurrent workers]
    MODE -->|no| SEQ_LOOP

    subgraph SEQ_LOOP [Sequential Loop — per issue]
        direction TB
        SKIP_CHECK{Already completed\nor split?} -->|yes| NEXT_ISSUE([Next issue])
        SKIP_CHECK -->|no| DEP_CHECK

        DEP_CHECK{Dependencies\nmet?} -->|no| HALT_DEP([HALT — unmet deps])
        DEP_CHECK -->|yes| SPLIT_CHECK

        SPLIT_CHECK{--skip-split?\nor small?} -->|small enough| WORKTREE
        SPLIT_CHECK -->|too large| SPLIT[Create sub-issues on GitHub]
        SPLIT --> REFETCH[Re-fetch issues\nRebuild graph] --> SKIP_CHECK

        WORKTREE[Create git worktree\nwith dependency branches] --> IMPLEMENT

        IMPLEMENT[Agent implementation\nClaude + acceptEdits mode]
        IMPLEMENT --> IMPL_RETRY{Success?}
        IMPL_RETRY -->|no, retries left| IMPLEMENT
        IMPL_RETRY -->|no, exhausted| HALT_IMPL([HALT — impl failed])
        IMPL_RETRY -->|yes| ZERO_DIFF

        ZERO_DIFF[Zero-diff check\ngit diff --stat] --> HAS_CHANGES{Changes\nexist?}
        HAS_CHANGES -->|no| HALT_ZERO([HALT — no changes])
        HAS_CHANGES -->|yes| VERIFY_LOOP

        VERIFY_LOOP[Run verification\ntsc / lint / test / build]
        VERIFY_LOOP --> VERIFY_OK{All pass?}
        VERIFY_OK -->|no, retries left| FIX_VERIFY[Fix agent\nfeeds errors back] --> VERIFY_LOOP
        VERIFY_OK -->|no, exhausted| HALT_VERIFY([HALT — verify failed])
        VERIFY_OK -->|yes| REQ_GATE

        REQ_GATE{--skip-requirements?}
        REQ_GATE -->|yes| CREATE_PR
        REQ_GATE -->|no| REQ_CHECK

        REQ_CHECK[Requirements check\nLLM assesses diff vs criteria\n+ substance heuristic]
        REQ_CHECK --> REQ_OK{Criteria\nmet?}
        REQ_OK -->|no, retries left| FIX_REQ[Fix agent\nfeeds unmet criteria back] --> REQ_CHECK
        REQ_OK -->|no, exhausted| HALT_REQ([HALT — requirements unmet])
        REQ_OK -->|yes| CREATE_PR

        CREATE_PR[Create PR\npush branch + gh pr create] --> CLEANUP

        CLEANUP[Remove worktree\nMark issue completed] --> SPLIT_PARENT

        SPLIT_PARENT{Is sub-issue\nof a split parent?}
        SPLIT_PARENT -->|no| SINGLE_CHECK
        SPLIT_PARENT -->|yes, siblings pending| SINGLE_CHECK
        SPLIT_PARENT -->|yes, all complete| CLOSE_PARENT[Close parent issue\non GitHub] --> SINGLE_CHECK

        SINGLE_CHECK{--single?}
        SINGLE_CHECK -->|yes| DONE_SINGLE([Done — single mode])
        SINGLE_CHECK -->|no| NEXT_ISSUE
    end

    PARALLEL --> DONE_ALL
    NEXT_ISSUE --> DONE_ALL([All issues completed])

    %% New features (green — dark text on strong green)
